        "pl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5031d15f-7c95-320d-9abd-d098030e8306",
                "word": "tłumnie",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd20020e-73a3-3529-84a9-d1a378b76bb7",
                        "entry_id": "5031d15f-7c95-320d-9abd-d098030e8306",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w dużej grupie osób"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab2e0565-f1ea-4729-8a84-c245878cd937",
                                "sense_id": "cd20020e-73a3-3529-84a9-d1a378b76bb7",
                                "text": "Mieszkańcy miasta przybyli tłumnie na plac zamkowy."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "071cc885-c387-42bb-9d90-2a6095003403",
                        "source_entry_id": "5031d15f-7c95-320d-9abd-d098030e8306",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd20020e-73a3-3529-84a9-d1a378b76bb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "multitudinously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "multitudinously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f301a67-13a1-3b03-920f-06dbbb151216",
                                        "entry_id": "4cc6d146-5063-32c4-bd6d-7b17584920c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a multitudinous way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ed18912-f1a3-4de1-86f3-69921a4f41f5",
                                                "sense_id": "1f301a67-13a1-3b03-920f-06dbbb151216",
                                                "text": "[…] human affairs are multitudinously complex […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e3c191e-a78e-4e07-acbc-b0077e546d43",
                                                "sense_id": "1f301a67-13a1-3b03-920f-06dbbb151216",
                                                "text": "Among the fishermen, he is indiscriminately designated by all the following titles: The Whale; the Greenland Whale; the Black Whale; the Great Whale; the True Whale; the Right Whale. There is a deal of obscurity concerning the identity of the species thus multitudinously baptised."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db1af20e-91cb-4ca9-8e57-74f1e1d92528",
                                                "sense_id": "1f301a67-13a1-3b03-920f-06dbbb151216",
                                                "text": "When one makes his first voyage in a ship, it is an experience which multitudinously bristles with striking novelties; novelties which are in such sharp contrast with all this person’s former experiences that they take a seemingly deathless grip upon his imagination and memory."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fcad6198-8486-4015-8617-73a00ddce47e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5031d15f-7c95-320d-9abd-d098030e8306",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd20020e-73a3-3529-84a9-d1a378b76bb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "en masse",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en masse",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                        "entry_id": "659eafae-1ab8-33d1-9a2e-a8e26f5cd4df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a single body or group; as one, together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0a5c849-8b2b-4995-89d0-56c0fc3708e6",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "[L]et the clergy, en Maſſe, preach him down, admoniſh their ſeveral congregations to be attentive to the duty they owe to the beſt of kings and to their country, and to ſeek to deprecate, by the holineſs of their lives, the wrath of the Almighty."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1eed85de-0b72-49b1-964f-d9e2b5b910c0",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "In the case of the very large caps called detonators, which are used in firing dynamite and gun cotton, is there not some risk of explosion en masse?—Yes, if you get large quantities of percussion powder together, there would be greater danger; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "872dc7bf-12d0-444e-ab4a-012ac4f43267",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "He [Goh Siew Tin] had traded largely with Java, and on the day of his funeral all the Chinese shops trading in Java produce were closed, while the pupils of the Toh Lam (Hokien) Mandarin School (of which Mr. Goh Siew Tin was President) en masse attended the funeral."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3902861-3206-4508-965e-2fba911fdbda",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "During inclement weather it is necessary for this group to meet in one gymnasium. Therefore it was decided to consider the whole group as one class. Two instructors are assigned to each class. Part of the work is given en masse, and for the remainder the class is divided between the two instructors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06fd6a82-87b2-4a7d-980b-da9255c53759",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "Low flow trips shall be individually adjustable. The low flow limits of all channels shall be adjustable en masse. The en masse adjustment shall be capable of modifying all individual trips by a common percentage of each trip setting."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d911cab8-5ecf-42b0-b9ce-958c47887852",
                                                "sense_id": "86accf78-6b9d-3094-a214-e57eba0323d6",
                                                "text": "Again the home players celebrated en masse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc09f93c-17d9-39b1-8f4c-a06f8cce1ee0",
                                        "entry_id": "659eafae-1ab8-33d1-9a2e-a8e26f5cd4df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In large amounts or numbers, massively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1d29392a-0384-436e-bf34-559bb447bf7e",
                        "source_entry_id": "5031d15f-7c95-320d-9abd-d098030e8306",
                        "source_sense_id": "cd20020e-73a3-3529-84a9-d1a378b76bb7",
                        "target_lang_word": "en masse",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "en masse",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd8411c9-26bb-390d-bea7-bde7d19329b0",
                                        "entry_id": "42a0b265-3858-3fe5-bb70-d1cd0fddf53b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tous ensemble, en totalité ; en grand nombre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0462d5c5-bb68-4d34-bb89-e7b611387f63",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8411c9-26bb-390d-bea7-bde7d19329b0",
                                                "text": "Aller, se porter, se lever en masse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7eb66feb-5f4d-45b1-9bb2-38de892061ea",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8411c9-26bb-390d-bea7-bde7d19329b0",
                                                "text": "Devant l’imminence du péril, on a décrété la levée en masse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8edd5809-3f8a-4c86-8769-21e6393faec3",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8411c9-26bb-390d-bea7-bde7d19329b0",
                                                "text": "[Titre] Les Hongkongais manifestent en masse contre le risque d’extradition vers la Chine"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06bb63b1-0a6f-44e1-b4e5-0108c4f0aca0",
                                                "sense_id": "fd8411c9-26bb-390d-bea7-bde7d19329b0",
                                                "text": "En outre, ainsi que le déclaraient sans détour les sénateurs Ron Wyden, Mark Udall et Martin Heinrich dans le New York Times, la collecte en masse de relevés téléphoniques n’a rien fait pour renforcer la protection de l’Amérique contre la menace du terrorisme."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ddf0941d-916c-34c1-a659-cd98181758f8",
                                        "entry_id": "42a0b265-3858-3fe5-bb70-d1cd0fddf53b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Beaucoup, énormément, en abondance­, en grande quantité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1de8811a-3c8e-46b5-acdd-18f343ddbab6",
                                                "sense_id": "ddf0941d-916c-34c1-a659-cd98181758f8",
                                                "text": "Alors oui, ce retour du Jeudi, ce 28 juillet, avec Cali en « guest-star » a été particulièrement goûté par le public, venu en masse célébrer les retrouvailles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1aab1c6-7e6c-40ce-89fa-540b4fe96564",
                                                "sense_id": "ddf0941d-916c-34c1-a659-cd98181758f8",
                                                "text": "L’épouvante était en ville, car les brigands sur leur chemin répandaient le sang en masse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b09050d6-8e22-4a78-a2fc-16d2ae721c25",
                                                "sense_id": "ddf0941d-916c-34c1-a659-cd98181758f8",
                                                "text": "Il te reste en masse de temps à faire pour te préparer!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d86cbbcd-ba62-43fb-871b-cbf8ff15deaf",
                                                "sense_id": "ddf0941d-916c-34c1-a659-cd98181758f8",
                                                "text": "Les péages à flux libre, en développement en France, piègent toujours de nombreux automobilistes. Une mauvaise nouvelle pour ces derniers, contraints de payer de lourdes amendes à cause d'un manque de connaissances ou d'erreurs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcf8113a-1e90-3020-ae80-a3e01cd04100",
                                        "entry_id": "42a0b265-3858-3fe5-bb70-d1cd0fddf53b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "En bloc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce15237f-2cfb-46d4-ab63-c80e837ed3b0",
                                                "sense_id": "fcf8113a-1e90-3020-ae80-a3e01cd04100",
                                                "text": "Ce qu’il avait d’abord senti en masse, il le sent ensuite en détail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc215842-ed08-41fd-b73d-addcf465e234",
                                                "sense_id": "fcf8113a-1e90-3020-ae80-a3e01cd04100",
                                                "text": "Combien vous coûtent-elles [les armes], dit-il ? − Je vous jure que je l’ignore, parce qu’étant achetées en bloc, et vous les livrant au triage, il faudra leur donner un prix, non pas en masse, mais à la pièce, et cela n’est pas facile à faire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
